{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04855","headline":"江上逢春 · 张均","name":"江上逢春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离忧耿未和，春虑忽蹉跎。\n择木猿知去，寻泥燕独过。\n惊花飜霁日，垂柳拂烟波。\n激意屡怡赏，无如乡念何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}